        "body": "Undersea Sensor Systems obligations are concentrated in Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing, which accounts for $241M. Undersea Sensor Systems also has smaller obligations in Other Aircraft Parts and Auxiliary Equipment Manufacturing ($2.1M), Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing ($1.4M), and Other Communications Equipment Manufacturing ($574K)."
      },
